[line]

[size=4][b][color=#ECC864]> OVERVIEW[/color][/b][/size]
[b]Nightreign Relic Extractor & Vessel Loadout Manager[/b] is a modern, standalone desktop tool designed specifically for [b]Elden Ring: Nightreign[/b] ([b]NR0000.co2[/b] save files). 

It empowers you to inspect your entire relic inventory, construct optimized character vessel builds (Urn, Goblet, Chalice, etc.) with color affinity matching, hotkey-swap loadouts in-game via a sleek transparent overlay HUD ([b]F10[/b]), and safely inject your custom builds directly into your save file with automatic MD5 checksum recalculation and automatic 4-backup rotation!

[line]

[size=4][b][color=#ECC864]> KEY FEATURES[/color][/b][/size]

[list]
[*][b][color=#ECC864]Dark Fantasy Gamer HUD:[/color][/b] Modern UI inspired by Elden Ring, Discord, and Steam UI with deep void backgrounds, card panels, and glowing affinity socket rings.
[*][b][color=#ECC864]In-Game Transparent Overlay (F10):[/color][/b] Press [b]F10[/b] anytime while playing to pull up a semi-transparent HUD overlay. Switch presets on the fly without alt-tabbing!
[*][b][color=#ECC864]Vessel Loadout Builder:[/color][/b] Support for all 10 characters and all 7 vessel types. Visually configure your 3 Normal slots and 3 Deep slots with live affinity matching ([color=#E05252]Red[/color], [color=#4A90E2]Blue[/color], [color=#F5C542]Yellow[/color], [color=#3CB371]Green[/color], and [color=#9B72CF]Any[/color]) and comprehensive in-game passive effect descriptions.
[*][b][color=#5ADCA0]1-Click Save File Injection & Auto-MD5 Recalculation:[/color][/b] 100% safe. Whenever you equip a build, the tool automatically recomputes the internal MD5 checksum required by the game engine, preventing "Save Data Corrupted" warnings.
[*][b][color=#5ADCA0]4-Backup Timestamped Rotation:[/color][/b] Automatically creates timestamped [b].bak[/b] backups before every single save write (keeps up to 4 historical backups, automatically rotating the oldest).
[*][b][color=#ECC864]AI Build Architect (ChatGPT / Claude):[/color][/b] 1-click export of your current relic collection into optimized prompts for ChatGPT or Claude to design Meta, Fun, Support, or Hybrid builds, with instant JSON copy/paste import.
[*][b][color=#ECC864]Relic Inventory Extractor:[/color][/b] Decrypts and exports your full relic inventory to [b]CSV[/b] and styled [b]Excel (.xlsx)[/b] spreadsheets with full multi-effect breakdown and values.
[*][b][color=#ECC864]Multi-Language Support:[/color][/b] Fully translated in [b]English[/b], [b]French[/b], and [b]Arabic[/b] (with right-to-left layout formatting).
[*][b][color=#ECC864]Zero Dependencies & Portable:[/color][/b] A single standalone executable ([b]NightreignRelicExtractor.exe[/b]). Requires no external mod loaders, no DLL injection, no Python, and no extra runtimes.
[/list]

