[size=4][b][color=#ECC864]> HOW TO INSTALL & USE[/color][/b][/size]

[list=1]
[*][b]Download & Extract:[/b] Download the [b]NightreignRelicExtractor-v1.5.0.zip[/b] archive from the Files tab and extract [b]NightreignRelicExtractor.exe[/b] anywhere you like (e.g. Desktop or game directory).
[*][b]Run the App:[/b] Double-click [b]NightreignRelicExtractor.exe[/b]. It will automatically detect your active Nightreign save file in [b]%APPDATA%\Nightreign\[/b].
[*][b]Build or Equip a Loadout:[/b]
  [list]
  [*]Head to the [b]Vessel Builder[/b] tab, select your character and vessel.
  [*]Click [b]Change...[/b] on any slot to search, filter by affinity, and select from your collected relics.
  [*]Click [b]Equip & Save to Save File[/b] to inject the loadout into your save.
  [/list]
[*][b]In-Game Activation:[/b] In Elden Ring: Nightreign, quit to the Main Menu and click [b]Continue[/b] or [b]Load Game[/b]. Your character will load with the newly equipped relics!
[*][b]In-Game Overlay (F10):[/b] While the tool is running, press [b]F10[/b] anytime in-game to toggle the overlay and switch saved builds instantly.
[/list]

[line]

[size=4][b][color=#5ADCA0]> SAFETY & MULTIPLAYER COMPATIBILITY[/color][/b][/size]

[quote]
[b]Is this safe to use online?[/b]
Yes! Nightreign Relic Extractor operates entirely at the save-file level ([b]NR0000.co2[/b]). It does NOT hook into game memory, does NOT alter executable code, and does NOT run active background hooks that trigger Anti-Cheat.

Furthermore, other players in co-op sessions do NOT need this tool installed - your equipped relics are standard in-game items stored directly in your genuine save data.
[/quote]

